# p_789a — Priya walks the dog in the morning; Elena handles the evening

Priya feeds the dog at 6:45 (dog bowl at the kitchen floor) and walks it 7:00–8:00 before Elena leaves for work. The dog toy is carried out on the walk (OUT_OF_HOUSE 7–8). Elena returns at 17:30 and walks the dog again 18:00–19:00, carrying the toy out. Priya is home all day otherwise, with afternoon errands 14:00–16:00 (water bottle goes out). Elena commutes all five weekdays with laptop, backpack, wallet, hat, helmet, bike lock, and umbrella. Meals at the dining table 12–13:30 and 18:30–20. TV 20:00–22:30. Priya's guitar in the bedroom 21–22.

What sets this apart: the dog toy is OUT_OF_HOUSE in the morning (7–8) with Priya, not just in the evening. The dog bowl is empty and at the sink by 7:00 (washed after Priya's feeding). What would refute it: dog_toy_shared sighted at floor_l_l1 at 7:30 on a weekday, or the dog bowl still at floor_k_k1 at 7:30.

